Subject: Re: cut_number function. What is 'breaks'?
Message-ID: <8TAfBE4hinI.JIkmxpKkCQAJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <8TAfBE4hinI.AcGm6bSKCQAJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
