Subject: Re: Issue with Geom_Rect
Message-ID: <zUrZTY4FaK4.uUSap9z_CQAJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <zUrZTY4FaK4.Y1nIdYXpCAAJ@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
